OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 24 JAN
OL,4,G2145FMusic Planet
OL,5,     GKathryn Tickell selects music
OL,6,     Gfrom around the globe, and
OL,7,     GScottish singer Julie Fowlis
OL,8,     Gshares a Return Journey in two
OL,9,     Gtracks: one for the road, and one
OL,10,     Gthat reminds her of home.
OL,11,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,12,     GItalian composer Silvia Tarozzi
OL,13,     Gshares her essential listening
OL,14,     Gwith Kate Molleson. Plus more
OL,15,     Gfrom Latvia's Skanu mezs festival.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GMahler's haunting Ruckert Lieder
OL,18,     Gwith Latvian mezzo-soprano Elina
OL,19,     GGaranca feature in this concert
OL,20,     Gfrom Switzerland, alongside
OL,21,     GMahler's Tenth Symphony and
OL,22,     GBoulez's Memoriale.
